sychic; the book''s odds are a restriction line. Magic none: a restriction line. || SKILLS: Language: Dakir (98%) as a fixed Language: Other pick (no Dakir row; none stubbed). Native tongue 98; one language of choice +10 as a Language: Other pick; Basic Radio -> Radio: Basic 45+15 = 60; Detect Ambush 30+10 = 40; W.P. Energy Rifle, Energy Pistol; W.P. Axe exists in the catalog and is used, the book''s ''treat as W.P. Blunt'' kept as its note; Hand to Hand: Expert to Martial Arts for one other skill (costs martial_arts 1). The +1 attack at level one is the race''s own, not Hand to Hand''s. || RELATED: six, plus one at levels 3, 6, 8, 11 and 13; all Any with the printed bonuses, Medical Paramedic only (+5%). Secondary: six, same limits without bonuses. || EQUIPMENT: Mark II body armor; HRP-1 or HIAR-22; one energy weapon of choice as a choice of the Legion''s own arms; 4 E-clips or magazines for each -> e-clip x8 with a note; survival knife; first-aid kit. ''Field kit'' has no catalog row and is not stored. Retired veterans'' kit is a restriction line. || MONEY: 2000 credits a month, starting with one month''s pay -> starting_money 2000, the coalition-grunt reading (fix-missing-starting-money.sql). The combat hazard bonus is side_effects prose."
